  <Placemark>
    <name>Indianola Cemetery</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[From Port Lavaca, take FM 238 s/SW 3 miles to FM 316 &amp;follow about 8.75 miles  to Brighton Rd. in Indianola. Follow Brighton Road NW about 1 mile then go WE on Comal Rd. .5 mile, and then Orleans St. .25 mile to cemetery.<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> Port Lavaca]]></description>
    <Point><coordinates>-96.509041524183,28.5192425016528,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
